msgctxt "136"
msgid "(Psst! Hey, you! You here to play darts, man?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "Chi sei?"

msgctxt "160"
msgid "(The name's Masaki. Listen, you see that girl over there?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"(It took a lot for her to go out with me, so now I gotta make sure I impress"
" her.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"(Please, if you could just lose a game of darts against me, I'll definitely "
"make it worth your while! I promise!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Better ask somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"(Urk... But you're my only hope! Think it over, okay? And come back if you "
"change your mind.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Well, all right. I guess I could stand a game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "(Thank you so much! Could you come over here for a sec?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Kanae-chan? This guy wants to play darts, so I'm just gonna have a quick "
"round with him, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Oh, okay. I didn't know you could play darts, Masaki-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Sure I can! I don't wanna brag, but I'm pretty famous for it around these "
"parts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Anyhow, I better go get ready! Gotta check the shafts and flights, and "
"stuff. I'll be right back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "(Excuse me, but... did he ask you to lose on purpose?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "You're pretty sharp."
msgstr "Sei piuttosto felice."

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"He probably just wants to show off. That's what he always does, and I'm kind"
" of sick of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Would you beat the pants off him? Maybe that'll teach him a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Oops! He's coming back. Don't forget what I said, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "My darts are ready for action. How about you? Ready to get started?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "We'll play a game of '01. Ready? Let's go!"
msgstr ""

